# Reviewed dtbs_check warnings for apple/t7001-j81.dtb (kernel/dtbs-check/README.md).
# One normalized warning per line, exactly as j81-dtbs-check writes them to warnings.txt,
# each with a comment saying why it is accepted. Reviewed 2026-11-01 against dtschema 2025.12.

# Patch 0010/0017: our J81 D2207 charger child has no binding YAML yet (driver is project-local).
arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t7001-j81.dtb: /soc/i2c@20a110000/pmic@3c/charger: failed to match any schema with compatible: ['apple,j81-d2207-charger']

# Patch 0004/0006: provisional HDQ-over-UART gauge compatible; no binding until DEVICE_TYPE settles the name.
arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t7001-j81.dtb: /soc/serial@20a0d4000/gauge: failed to match any schema with compatible: ['ti,bq27540-hdq-uart']

# Patch 0007/0008: compatible added to spi-apple.c but not to apple,spi.yaml.
arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t7001-j81.dtb: /soc/spi@20a08c000: failed to match any schema with compatible: ['apple,s5l8960x-spi']

# Patch 0089/0090: J81 DART option properties, undocumented test toggles read from the DT (apple,pci-alias dropped by 0123).
arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t7001-j81.dtb: iommu@602002000 (apple,t7000-dart): 'apple,diag-config', 'apple,error-reflector', 'apple,fetch-config', 'apple,ios-pte' do not match any of the regexes: '^pinctrl-[0-9]+$' [from schema $id: http://devicetree.org/schemas/iommu/apple,dart.yaml]

# Patch 0010: apple,pmic.yaml does not allow a charger child.
arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t7001-j81.dtb: pmic@3c (apple,arabela-pmic): 'charger' does not match any of the regexes: '^backlight(@[0-9a-f]+)?$', '^nvmem(@[0-9a-f]+)?$', '^pinctrl-[0-9]+$', '^rtc(@[0-9a-f]+)?$' [from schema $id: http://devicetree.org/schemas/mfd/apple,pmic.yaml]

# Patch 0092/0093: Bluetooth UART sampling-factor property, undocumented in samsung_uart.yaml.
arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t7001-j81.dtb: serial@20a0cc000 (apple,s5l-uart): Unevaluated properties are not allowed ('apple,baud-factor-select' was unexpected) [from schema $id: http://devicetree.org/schemas/serial/samsung_uart.yaml]

# Patch 0006: samsung_uart.yaml does not allow a serdev child node.
