# Patch 0051/0095/0097: disabled spidev touch-diag child; trivial-devices.yaml rejects its SPI timing properties.
arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t7001-j81.dtb: touch-diag@0 (rohm,dh2228fv): 'spi-cpol', 'spi-cs-hold-delay-ns', 'spi-cs-setup-delay-ns' do not match any of the regexes: '^pinctrl-[0-9]+$' [from schema $id: http://devicetree.org/schemas/trivial-devices.yaml]

# Patch 0090: Wi-Fi endpoint sits on bus 1 but its root port has no bus-range; harmless at runtime (Linux assigns buses), worth a bus-range = <1 1> later.
arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t7001.dtsi:476.24-480.7: Warning (pci_device_bus_num): /soc/pcie@610000000/pci@1,0/network@0,0: PCI bus number 1 out of range, expected (0 - 0)

# Patch 0123: five-cell iommu-map (stream, window base, window length), the form the pinned apple-dart of_xlate parses and
# OrchardLinux's J81 DT uses. pci-iommu.yaml assumes a one-cell specifier and reads the window base as the entry length.
arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t7001-j81.dtb: pcie@610000000 (apple,t7000-pcie): iommu-map:1:0: 2147483648 is greater than the maximum of 65535 [from schema $id: http://devicetree.org/schemas/pci/pci-iommu.yaml]
